& [JustificationIdentity] is the SJS implementation rationale
  + [justification_uuid] is 770a292c-a08f-4cb7-a2a4-73654dfbc85c
  + [solution_uuid] is 143e3bdd-1cdd-4b8f-89af-72369f15c0eb
